  }

  <p><strong>The SAGE Makine approach:</strong> With 22 years of industry experience, we start the conversation not with price but with the right configuration for your product. Tell us about your product and your capacity — we will put a written quotation in front of you covering every item, including carryover and air consumption.</p>
